  "extraction_notes": [
    "Absolute maximum ratings at Ta = 25 degC: VDSS = 20 V, continuous ID = +/-200 mA, pulsed IDP = +/-400 mA for pulse width <= 10 us and duty cycle <= 1%, VGSS = +/-8 V, PD = 150 mW, Tj = 150 degC.",
    "The four RDS(on) table rows have typical and maximum values; both source meanings are represented as paired extraction entries because the strict schema provides one resistance object per entry.",
    "Ciss is 25 pF with VGS = 0 V; the table layout does not provide a separate VDS condition for that row. Coss is 10 pF at VDS = 10 V, and Crss is 10 pF at f = 1 MHz as printed.",
    "No typical threshold value is published; only the guaranteed 0.3 V minimum and 1.0 V maximum at VDS = 10 V and ID = 1 mA are transcribed.",
    "The datasheet publishes RthJA maximum 833 degC/W with each terminal mounted on a reference land; the MOSFET extraction schema has no thermal field.",
    "The datasheet publishes switching times but no gate-charge, reverse-recovery-time, or Qrr values; these have no fields in the strict extraction schema."
